  "summary_en": "Conceptual paper proposing an 'ethics by design' model for AI-integrated medical robots, especially surgical and telesurgery systems. It reviews EU ethics-by-design guidance and literature, identifies dilemmas of transparency, privacy, accountability and human control, and calls for proactive enforceable regulation and unified standards.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Ethics should be embedded from the concept stage of medical robot design, not added afterwards.",
